{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55950","headline":"谢秦王 · 何仲举","name":"谢秦王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三千里外抛渔艇，二十人前折桂枝。\n（见《增修诗话总龟》卷三六引《青琐集》）（〖1〗《青琐集》云：「王仲举，营道人，母尝梦挟仲举入月。\n仲举修进业，长兴〖化〗二年赴举，谒秦王登第，後有诗谢秦王）（曰〖略〗。\n太平兴国中，仲举有子曰嗣全，亦中进士第，乃挟两子入月之祥。\n」以《五代史补》卷二载何仲举事迹参证，知「王仲举」爲「何仲举」之误。\n二书所载及第年有异，未详孰是。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何仲举","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}